Privacy Policy

Urudhi — by ஒளியன் கலைக்கூடம்

Urudhi does not collect, sell, or share any personal data.

    Your workouts, settings and preferences are stored only on your device (as needed for app functionality). Urudhi does not send them to any server.
    The app has permission to access the internet. Currently this is used only for things you trigger yourself, such as opening links. If a feature is added that sends data to an online service, this policy will be updated first and the feature will make clear what is sent.
    This app does not include analytics, advertising or tracking.

